The existing-concept search covered grammar, HIRE, action codec, strict padding,
reference disagreement and L4. This note already owns those native semantics;
no duplicate concept is added. The reviewed Task 1.2 brief and the pinned
reference sampler/codec are independent design inputs; source hashes alone do
not establish semantic truth. Tests and native recordings in the linked
receipt will delimit the current version's claims.

The root registers `src/kaggriculture/grammar.rs` through
`src/kaggriculture.rs` and `src/lib.rs`, initially with typed enums, slot names
and widths. `grammar_tests.rs` establishes registration test-first. The trim
