`replay_parity.rs` and `grammar_kernel.rs`; the manifest registers the latter
as a temporary test-only include, without editing retained kernel bytes.
The contract v4.1, `docs/rl-api-specs.md` and the rebuild plan record Claude and
Codex's five agreed clarifications: sampler HIRE capacity, zero padding before
